  "item_short_desc": "<p>Engineered with a breathable 60% cotton / 40% polyester blend, the Midnight Camo T-Shirt provides unmatched resiliency and durability on the field. The camo tee easily withstands rigorous outdoor use while remaining comfortable. From night missions to an afternoon at the range, this stealthy t-shirt is a great addition to any wardrobe.</p>",
  "no_ratings": null,
  "sort_order": "133396",
  "description": "<p>Engineered with a breathable 60% cotton / 40% polyester blend, the Midnight Camo T-Shirt provides unmatched resiliency and durability on the field. The camo tee easily withstands rigorous outdoor use while remaining comfortable. From night missions to an afternoon at the range, this stealthy t-shirt is a great addition to any wardrobe. Ultimate Stealth Ops Camo: Inspired by stealth operations that require zero visibility to the opposition, Rothco has reinvented the classic Woodland Camouflage Pattern as well as our bestselling Black Camouflage Pattern to bring you the Midnight Camo Collection. The subdued color combinations offer a true stealth, sharp and sleek appearance whether on mission or off. Built for Action and Adventure: These crewneck tees consist of reinforced seams at the collar, sleeves, and bottom hem to further enhance the hunting shirt&rsquo;s durability. With a tag-less neck label, you are free to move around without any itches or scratches. Standard Fit: These camo t-shirts are standard fit, giving you the perfect amount of room and flexibility for any activity. Their length should go past the waist, providing you with additional coverage. We&rsquo;ve Got You Covered: Complete your wardrobe with a matching pair of Midnight Camo Tactical BDU Pants and Conceal-Ops Midnight Camo Hoodie.</p>",
